  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 65 * 81 * 9 * 10 * 8 * 8\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) + ÷ − × = \n\n65 * 81 * 9 * 10 * 8 * 8 ⇒ 65 + 81 ÷ 9 - 10 × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ 65 + __**81 **____**÷**____** 9**__ - 10 × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ 65 + 9 - __**10 **____**×**____** 8**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**65 + **____**9**__ - 80 = 8\n\n⇒ **__74__**__** - 80**__ = 8\n\n⇒ -6 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) ÷ + − × =\n\n65 * 81 * 9 * 10 * 8 * 8 ⇒ 65 ÷ 81 + 9 - 10 × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ __**65 ÷**____** 81**__ + 9 - 10 × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ 0.8 + 9 - __**10 **____**×**____** 8**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**0.8**____** + 9**__ - 80 = 8\n\n⇒ __9.8____** - 80**__ = 8\n\n⇒ -70.2 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) + ÷ − = × \n\n65 * 81 * 9 * 10 * 8 * 8 ⇒ 65 + 81 ÷ 9 - 10 = 8 × 8\n\n⇒ 65 + __**81 **____**÷**____** 9**__ - 10 = __**8 **____**× 8**__\n\n⇒ __**65 + **____**9**__ - 10 = 64\n\n⇒ **__74__**__** - 10**__ = 64\n\n⇒ 64 = 64 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 4) + − ÷ × =\n\n65 * 81 * 9 * 10 * 8 * 8 ⇒ 65 + 81 - 9 ÷ 10 × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ 65 + 81 - __**9 **____**÷**____** 10**__ × 8 = 8\n\n⇒ 65 + 81 - __**0.9**____** ×**____** 8**__ = 8\n\n⇒ __**65 + 81**__ - 7.2 = 8\n\n⇒ __146** - 7.2**__ = 8\n\n⇒ 138.8 ≠ 8 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
